  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T17
  Title: 'Custom Property: vectors and colour'
  Summary: Custom Property on plain public fields - a Vector3, a Color and a string
    - and on a Unity property, RectTransform's Vector2 sizeDelta.
  Watch: Fields, Sized
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 2132741593}
  - {fileID: 610795619}
  HowTo: 'Play <b>Animate Fields</b> and <b>Grow Sized</b>. Then open the Property
    dropdown on a step of Animate Fields: it lists the members of each component
    on Fields.'
  Expect: Fields turns 135 degrees, tints orange and retypes its caption, all together.
    Sized grows to 180 x 120 with a slight overshoot. The dropdown lists Angles,
    Tint and Caption under TestFields.
