  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T12
  Title: Set Active
  Summary: Turns an object on or off at a moment in the animation. The path reaches
    a hidden object too.
  Watch: Lamp (starts hidden - the outline marks it)
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 780271178}
  HowTo: Play <b>Blink</b>. Then <b>On</b>, and <b>Off</b>. Stop and Restore afterwards.
  Expect: 'Blink: the star appears half a second in and disappears a second later.
    On / Off switch it straight away. Stop and Restore leaves it hidden, as it was.'
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
