  - {fileID: 1424163299}
  HowTo: Play <b>Spin</b>, <b>Tilt</b>, then <b>Upright</b>.
  Expect: Spin turns one full turn clockwise and ends upright (a To beyond 360 really
    spins). Tilt leans it 25 degrees left. Upright puts it back.
