  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Click plays a short click, slightly differently pitched
    each time, and <b>UI Animation Audio</b> appears under DontDestroyOnLoad. Pop
    plays higher (pitch 1.4) from Own Source's AudioSource. Jingle plays from Speaker.
    Rapid clicks overlap rather than cut off. In the edit-mode preview, nothing sounds.
