      m_Calls: []
  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Heal fills the bar from 10 to 100 HP while Coins counts
    in whole numbers to 250. Count Up counts from 120 to 15,000 with a thousands
    separator. Type writes the line letter by letter, and the bold tag inside it
    never shows half-typed. Stop and Restore puts back 75 HP, 12 coins, 120 and an
    empty line. The dropdown lists Health and Coins under TestGauge, but not HealthFraction
    (read-only), OldHealth ([Obsolete]) or IsAlive (a bool).
