  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T15
  Title: Shake
  Summary: A random wobble that settles back where it started.
  Watch: Shake Pos, Shake Rot, Shake Scale
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 428721631}
  - {fileID: 1900974378}
  - {fileID: 1833520722}
  HowTo: Play <b>Shake All</b>, a few times.
  Expect: Each box jitters (sideways and up/down, twisting in the plane of the screen
    only, bigger and smaller) then settles exactly where it started. The middle box
    never tips over in 3D.
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
