  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T6
  Title: Offset Min / Offset Max
  Summary: Moves an element's left/bottom edges (Offset Min) or right/top edges (Offset
    Max), holding the opposite corner still.
  Watch: Panel, stretched inside Frame
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 951703237}
  HowTo: Play <b>Inset Left-Bottom</b>, then <b>Inset Right-Top</b>, then <b>Reset
    Edges</b>. Select Panel during the second and read its Right and Top in the RectTransform.
  Expect: 'The first pulls only the left and bottom edges in; the top-right corner
    stays put. The second pulls the right and top edges in: the step''s (-120, -60)
    shows as Right 120, Top 60 in the Inspector (Unity flips their sign). Reset Edges
    puts both back at 12.'
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
  Header: {fileID: 2036533345}
  Stage: {fileID: 373821902}
  Footer: {fileID: 2112497583}
