  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T13
  Title: Play Sound
  Summary: Plays a clip from the step's Audio Source, else the player's own, else
    a shared 2D source the tool makes.
  Watch: the three buttons; the Hierarchy's DontDestroyOnLoad
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 12294508}
  - {fileID: 782592313}
  - {fileID: 1707524455}
  HowTo: Enter play mode and click each button in the Game view. Click <b>Click</b>
    rapidly a few times. Then try the Play buttons in the edit-mode preview.
  Expect: Click plays a short click, slightly differently pitched each time, and
    <b>UI Animation Audio</b> appears under DontDestroyOnLoad. Pop plays higher (pitch
    1.4) from Own Source's AudioSource. Jingle plays from Speaker. Rapid clicks overlap
    rather than cut off. In the edit-mode preview, nothing sounds.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 300
  Header: {fileID: 212879362}
  Stage: {fileID: 89314532}
  Footer: {fileID: 272781968}
