  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> The first pulls only the left and bottom edges in; the
    top-right corner stays put. The second pulls the right and top edges in: the
    step''s (-120, -60) shows as Right 120, Top 60 in the Inspector (Unity flips
    their sign). Reset Edges puts both back at 12.'
